  "solution": "Bảng mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm được viết lại như sau:\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Thời gian</td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số cuộc gọi</td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>17</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>25</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\tMẫu số liệu có cỡ mẫu là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>…</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>80</mn></msub></semantics></math> là thời gian đàm thoại của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math> cuộc gọi được sắp xếp theo thứ tự không giảm.<br>\n\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu gốc là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhóm chứa tứ phân vị thứ nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>80</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>17</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>29</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu gốc là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>60</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>61</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhóm chứa tứ phân vị thứ ba là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy khoảng tứ phân vị của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>29</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
